Description: 
    Various graph-based methods commonly used in computational biology. Heat 
    diffusions over networks, node2vec and metapath2vec-based analyses over 
    biologicals networks in R powered by Rust. Includes GeneWalkR and 
    co-expression gene drift detection methods based on node2vec.
